Subject: [PATCH] Register unary interface initializers explicitly

Keep genuine GInterfaceInitFunc callbacks at their public two-argument arity.
These initializers take one argument and use the explicit GLib adapter.

--- a/tests/glibmm_interface_move/main.cc
+++ b/tests/glibmm_interface_move/main.cc
@@ -80,7 +80,7 @@
 }
 
 G_DEFINE_TYPE_EXTENDED(TestDerived, test_derived, G_TYPE_OBJECT, 0,
-  G_IMPLEMENT_INTERFACE(TEST_TYPE_IFACE, test_Iface_init))
+  G_IMPLEMENT_INTERFACE_UNARY(TEST_TYPE_IFACE, test_Iface_init))
 
 class TestInterface;
 
